  "body": "This patch factors out the code to handle fulfillment/rejection of sink write and sink close operation into separate methods to make it easier to follow the code and check the correctness of the logic.\r\n\r\nThis patch also clarifies the interface boundary, i.e. factoring out operations that are exposed by the WritableStream to controllers.\r\n\r\nThis PR is recreation of #640.",
